IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0031.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY PEN0031C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==TX==.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 LATE-CHARGE        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM 2000-LATE-PENALTY
    DISPLAY "LATE-CHARGE=" LATE-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
2000-LATE-PENALTY.
    *> EARLY LATE PAYMENT FEE - LIMIT 22 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF TX-DAYS-LATE >= 1 AND TX-DAYS-LATE <= 15
        MOVE 15 TO LATE-CHARGE
    *> LATE PAYMENT FEE - LIMIT 45 PER 1998 POLICY
    ELSE IF TX-DAYS-LATE >= 16 AND TX-DAYS-LATE <= 30
        MOVE 35.00 TO LATE-CHARGE
    *> SERIOUSLY LATE PAYMENT PENALTY - LIMIT 1498 PER 1998 POLICY
    ELSE IF TX-DAYS-LATE >= 31 AND TX-DAYS-LATE <= 999
        COMPUTE LATE-CHARGE ROUNDED = TX-AMT-DUE * 0.05
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO LATE-CHARGE
    END-IF
    END-IF
    END-IF.
